I. Start Xming with access control disabled
   Start-Process "C:\Program Files (x86)\Xming\Xming.exe" -ArgumentList "-ac"

II. Make sure MariaDB accepts remote connections (run once in HeidiSQL)
   CREATE USER IF NOT EXISTS 'tempuser'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'temp123';
   GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON svg_temp_db.* TO 'tempuser'@'%';
   FLUSH PRIVILEGES;

III. Build the image and load it into Minikube
   mvn clean package
   docker build -t alii123x/temp-fx-localization:latest .
   docker save alii123x/temp-fx-localization:latest -o app-image.tar
   minikube image load app-image.tar
   Remove-Item app-image.tar

IV. Apply the manifests and start the pod
   kubectl apply -f k8s-manifests.yaml
   kubectl rollout restart deployment javafx-temp-app

V. Follow the logs and check that the window appears on the desktop
   kubectl logs -l app=javafx-temp-app -f
